							[quote=Kinladar]Under normal rules, I would have needed a full group with a good tank, and healing to bash my way through. Using a little luck, and brains, I managed to solo a tough quest.<br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote"></div><br />AH HA!!&nbsp; You admit to exploiting!&nbsp; You are no better then Conquest!&nbsp; Dont you realize that there is only the 1 right way to do something....I guess Blizzard learned that from Microsoft.<br /><br /><br />WoW does kind of force you to communicate with other people but the Solo aspect of it is also a plus.&nbsp; I remember some suck days in EQ where i would log on my Cleric, not get a group an not be able to do anything cause a cleric cant solo effectivly (yes, yes, there are some places...but not good xp).<br /><br />In WoW, everyone has the ability to at least solo the mobs at their level and complete quests and be utterly unsociable if they choose to.&nbsp; On the plus side, if you go to Ironforge you can usually get a pickup group for an instance in a matter of 1-5 mins.<br /><br />IMO, the leveling in WoW is slower that it is in EQ1.&nbsp; I was able to take a Wizard from 0-65 and time flagged in 3 weeks of nightly play.&nbsp; Here i am at week 4 of WoW and I am only at lvl 36.<br /><br />Another cool feature of wow is that you can always be doing something.&nbsp; With EQ high end, you basically sat in PoE or PoF in one place for 12-18 hours a time grind out levels quickly.&nbsp; There is no real mechanism for that in WoW...Sure you can go solo an instance or stay running around in a general area killing everything that moves, and picking up everything that doesnt.<br /><br />I like the delivery quests where i have to go all over hell and back doing a UPS quy impression.&nbsp; Those long griff rides are the perfect length for a smoke break or grabing some food.&nbsp; Its cool to play a game where you can go AFK and still get stuff accomplished.<br /><br />Anyway, this wasnt supposed to be a Convert the EQ Heathens to WoW post....but.......
